
@UserService.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5296

### Create User
POST {{UserService.API_HostAddress}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "teste.swiftorders@example.com",
  "password": "MySafePassword123!"
}

###

### Get user by ID
# Replace the GUID below by the ID returned on user creation
GET {{UserService.API_HostAddress}}/api/users/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json

###

### Search non-existent ID 
GET {{UserService.API_HostAddress}}/api/users/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
Accept: application/json

###

### Search with empty GUID
GET {{UserService.API_HostAddress}}/api/users/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json
